        "TileImage": "$($repository 4b83cf74-a44e-4923-ac31-a1fccb92342f).Image",
        "Description": "A group of 3 people are working together on the Dark Web and are aiming to make lots of money by human and organ traficing. Their names are, Mario Saltatore which has been luring and killing innocent civillians and chucking their corps into caskets in the local sewer system underground, Araldo Labate, which has been selling human meat and organs in the local butchery of Sapienza, and, last but not least, Edmondo Giordano, which has been poisoning the suply of ice cream of the Gelateria Bella.",
